OL,3,GNEWSAWeekend rail engineering works
OL,4,Aplanned for October
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail engineering works in
OL,7,FCambridgeshire and parts of Norfolk
OL,8,Fhave been planned across each weekend
OL,9,Fin October.
OL,11,FIt will include works on the Fen Line
OL,12,Fbetween King's Lynn and Cambridge, but
OL,13,FGBR Anglia said it was not in response
OL,14,Fto recent issues that led to hundreds
OL,15,Fof trains being cancelled.
OL,17,FThe work includes renewing signals
OL,18,Fbetween Cambridge North and Ely,
OL,19,Fstation and platform work at Wymondham
OL,20,Fand track re-railing - with lines being
OL,21,Fclosed for safety reasons.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
